{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "9641a27dad8f25539c01bd8fba922f00a78071aa1612a23cb473ac173e3360fa", "ja": "見つけたーっ！　{$P$}さん、\nちょっと教えてくださいっ！", "zh": "找到你啦──！\n{$P$}先生，请你告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5363028ff4968a40eee5025e97c9fa22cdb29db820ed028791f585e75e9f1e17", "ja": "うわっ！　ど、どうした奈緒、\n何を教えてほしいんだ？", "zh": "哇！怎、怎么啦，奈绪？\n你要我告诉你什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "6dbe1f7ef6b2619bfa94d23a465d64990db5f14225785e395a05bfa795d4b147", "ja": "もしかして{$P$}さんは、\n私のこと……私のこと……！", "zh": "莫非{$P$}先生，\n你把我……把我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "23edf41b85506b0c5d10b483be97f5550031d5dc6da76b0a4561823152cdc3c9", "ja": "すっかり落ち着いた大人のレディや！\nと思ってくれてたんですか！？", "zh": "你是不是把我当成……\n从头到脚就是个沉着冷静的成熟淑女吼！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1dfbd7f4abc5899398afb21a76b56e9c9c26327a861afa48dc61d725b126773d", "ja": "えっ……。どうして俺が？", "zh": "咦……为什么你觉得我会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "e6bcd18dadf057c22f1b0b4fdc5d69dc2279adfeea3201eebf3d7c0c8564aae0", "ja": "だってこの衣装、めっちゃ可愛いしエレガントやし。\nこんなん、落ち着いたレディやないと似合わへん！", "zh": "因为这套服装超级可爱又优雅啊。\n这种风格，如果不是沉着冷静的淑女根本就不适合咧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "8911469052ec6299b345a19ba4fe82f63cddb9fb66690e4109a32d9219ec0508", "ja": "せやから、最初はめっちゃ嬉しかったけど……\nよう考えたら、私にはまだ早かった気してきて……", "zh": "所以说呀，虽然我一开始超高兴的……\n但仔细想想，又觉得这对我来说还太早了啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "c9d7eea0d15b280effd8f26f4db572282b461ae825240c1dfe3cc27f97ac634c", "ja": "夜も昼も、ちゃんと眠れんようになってきたんです！", "zh": "害我晚上跟白天都睡不着觉了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0f4143450e04eb23154dd2e4e83308295d62d0a9abbcc9e508d5839711684a49", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。\n昼は別にいい気もするけど……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n白天睡不着好像没差吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "dc5c066a6bfcc8cbe11ba059109b871f09d582c38369b7e9b3e9ff897db53f2b", "ja": "そしたらご飯ものどを通らんようになってきて、\nしゃーないから、おやつを多めに食べるようにして…。", "zh": "然后开始食不下咽，\n我不得已只好多吃点零食来补……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "c50cf74fce2f86159f3331c8edcff9f1d45f2294ac29df18a931c8dfa5171332", "ja": "そんなん太るに決まってるやないですか！\nそしたらますます、この衣装が似合わんようになる！", "zh": "这样当然会胖啊！\n然后就会越来越不适合这套服装了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "828b41d2bd491f91934fd00b15c6053b691177dacbbfcd0ca9cf71130aa148de", "ja": "だから教えてください、{$P$}さん！\nこんな私がこの衣装着て、ホンマに大丈夫なん！？", "zh": "所以你告诉我，{$P$}先生！\n像我这种人穿这套服装，真的没问题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1012_p", "source_sha256": "62eb27f1fec3c63efbdcd27188bfd4255869f71df2e16b2db1b9fba12f588778", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか。\nそれなら……", "zh": "原来如此，是这么一回事啊。\n那我可以告诉你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_1013", "source_sha256": "cae2544cc321338c0da652b971336f224832e83a8ff4292d5d2e3457b23c802c", "ja": "すごく似合ってる", "zh": "非常适合你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9c4c106c14a4bdda08581b0824cb3aab8f9d57f8d0d7cb45cc2a99bb9dcd89ad", "ja": "大丈夫、すごく似合ってるよ。\n思った通り、可愛くてエレガントだ。", "zh": "没问题的，非常适合你喔。\n跟我想的一样，既可爱又优雅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "51ee8ec3c4a6b8b37660d9c6d8df2ccb4243a299b694d13602ca4c995c487450", "ja": "……ホンマに？", "zh": "……真的假的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2002_p", "source_sha256": "d2ecced286225c3faffdcb183536e7d9f31b82a58828ea30008eaa91a13cb5c1", "ja": "もちろん奈緒は、すごくお淑やかってタイプじゃ\nないけど、アイドルはいろんな顔を見せないとな。", "zh": "当然奈绪并不是非常娴静的那种类型，\n但身为偶像就得展现各种不同的面貌啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2003_p", "source_sha256": "a0d297d8235820511debbbce7bcceced67dcd44aa130001c24b115f99627b693", "ja": "普段の奈緒も、今の奈緒も、すごくいいと思う。\nきっとファンのみんなも喜んでくれるぞ！", "zh": "不管是平时或现在的奈绪，我觉得都非常棒。\n粉丝们一定也会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "bd65feb5e74e0f0193377f615fff3c49b1dcc44330f9342dc382a7bdbffe983c", "ja": "そ、そっか……。えへへ、{$P$}さん\nがそうゆうてくれるんやったら、間違いないな！", "zh": "是、是吼……嘿嘿，\n既然{$P$}先生这么说，那肯定没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "e5d5326ecf2c6ce7c62dbf1f50993dd1d93eb1d4634ed14c52f43cfe9881130c", "ja": "ホンマありがとうな、{$P$}さん！\nこれでやっと、毎日グッスリ眠れるわ～♪", "zh": "真是谢谢你啦，{$P$}先生！\n这下我终于每天都能睡个好觉啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f9ec5e60effb0af8b5a1fb1b805770cfc2f000c6e88c5c33ec3ddef630fabad6", "ja": "はは、それは良かった。ゆっくり眠って、\nいつも元気いっぱいな奈緒でなくっちゃな！", "zh": "哈哈，那就太好了。\n奈绪就是要好好睡饱，总是充满活力才对啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2007_037nao", "source_sha256": "ce8215a9880c6bd43029d85c7f8409ca0afd8e0820a156f6d7ce650ad1ee65b9", "ja": "むふっ♪　これからもテンションあげてじゃんじゃん\nお仕事頑張りますから、遠慮せんといてくださいね！", "zh": "嘿呀♪\n今后我也会提起干劲继续努力工作，别客气尽管来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2008_p", "source_sha256": "14332ec0016d2443a714247f9d956cc75628b15dcd241ff763981e490e6c396e", "ja": "ちょうどいい。実は来月、奈緒がずっと出たがってた\n『銭湯巡り・食べ歩き旅』の出演が決まったぞ！", "zh": "那正好，其实你一直很想上的节目\n『澡堂巡礼‧美食带着走之旅』已经敲定下个月演出啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2009_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b72528ccdacbf561ff9ddeb350c9a577d939803f597b326dabab309fa2bc288", "ja": "えっ、ホンマですか！？\nホンマにあの、伝説の番組に！？", "zh": "咦，真的假的！？\n我真的要登上那个传说中的节目了吼！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2010_p", "source_sha256": "6de729ff2bee3f6c41d7d8ece193cc57c15de7cafc2b20015323b7ab14e39dd8", "ja": "ああ、関西のお茶の間に愛され続けて30年の、\nあの番組だ。よかったな！", "zh": "嗯，就是那个关西家家户户必看的30年长青节目。\n真是太好了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2011_037nao", "source_sha256": "71a844594d710bf42a92408bc539ebc2e160e3e06dacb1f26691ab5d108989ea", "ja": "……あかん！\n待ってください、{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "……糟啦！\n你等一下，{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2012_p", "source_sha256": "fba1d7e984c2ca7c4a3d397e0845d54e4791166decffb4ed1c37b4189c98cb8a", "ja": "え？　な、なにがダメなんだ？", "zh": "咦？有、有什么困难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2013_037nao", "source_sha256": "5e0c43d3025b5d2780266bbbe720f618928111afb7859a3e87afab06f114dbfd", "ja": "そんなん楽しみ過ぎて、また眠れんようになって\nしまいますやん！　どないしよ～！？", "zh": "这样我会因为太期待，又开始睡不着啦！\n该怎么办呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2014_p", "source_sha256": "eff7ea50b024ba9e1bd264fd7caf190b7e35cdc7d813e51e1690d412ba69e938", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうだな……よし！\n奈緒、違う番組だと思うんだ！　タイトルは……", "zh": "咦咦！？我、我想想……好！\n奈绪，你就想成是不同节目！节目名称是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2015_p", "source_sha256": "13953aff6df6ef78587f4de363fa781060b44d16adcd960702dbcdf5227e669f", "ja": "『弁当めくり・食べ歩かない旅』", "zh": "『便当巡礼‧美食不要走之旅』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0074_2017_p", "source_sha256": "5c30d23c084f2e342e4eed6432b17ab52bfe465d962e436f7599873ab5da46f9", "ja": "（渾身のダジャレで、奈緒のテンションは\n無事に下がった。……成功だな！）", "zh": "（我使尽浑身解数的冷笑话，\n顺利让亢奋的奈绪冷静下来……我成功了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
